    "— Gloria Steinem" : {

    },
    "— Whis, Dragon Ball Super" : {

    },
    "?" : {

    },
    "\"%@\"" : {

    },
    "\"Biblical angels: wheels covered in eyes, six-winged beings on fire, four-faced creatures. 'Be not afraid' because people were TERRIFIED. Then someone drew a cute baby with wings and called it a day. 👼\"" : {

    },
    "\"Hell isn't a place you go when you die. It's a state you're in when you don't know who you are. You might already be there. Gnosis is the way out. The fire isn't punishment - it's the burning of ignorance.\"" : {

    },
    "\"Push beyond your limits. That's what makes a Saiyan a Saiyan.\"" : {

    },
    "\"The body moves on its own.\"" : {

    },
    "\"The body moves on its own.\" — Whis" : {

    },
    "\"The Constitution doesn't GIVE you rights. You are BORN with natural rights. The Constitution PROTECTS those rights from government interference.\"" : {

    },
    "\"The most important subject never taught in school\"" : {

    },
    "\"The only prison is the one you don't know you're in.\"" : {

    },
    "\"The quality of your questions determines the quality of your life. Sit with this. Don't rush to an answer.\"" : {

    },
    "\"The truth will set you free—but first it will piss you off.\"" : {

    },
    "\"The wound is where the light enters you.\" You're not broken—you're breaking open. Let the old self grieve so the new self can emerge." : {

    },
    "\"They burned the Library of Alexandria. They buried the Nag Hammadi texts. They killed the Gnostics. The truth kept coming back. Now it's in your pocket.\"" : {

    },
    "\"They took the light-bringers and called them demons. The teachers became tempters. The awakeners became the enemy. Flip EVERY label they gave you.\"" : {

    },
    "\"They wrote the book. They edited the book. They translated the book. They taught you to never question the book. Maybe start there.\"" : {

    },
    "\"This course won't give you answers—it will show you that you ARE the answer. The one who questions consciousness is consciousness questioning itself.\"" : {

    },
    "\"When the student is ready, the teacher appears.\"" : {

    },
    "\"You didn't fall INTO this world. You came from ABOVE it. The journey isn't up - it's remembering.\"" : {

    },
